{"id":"ahio","name":"Ahio","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:ahio"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Ahio","text":"Brotherly. (1.) One of the sons of Beriah (1 Chr. 8:14). (2.) One of the sons of Jehiel the Gibeonite (1 Chr. 8:31; 9:37). (3.) One of the sons of Abinadab the Levite. While Uzzah went by the side of the ark, he walked before it guiding the oxen which drew the cart on which it was carried, after having brought it from his father’s house in Gibeah (1 Chr. 13:7; 2 Sam. 6:3, 4)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","xlit":"ʼAchyôw","gloss":"Achio, the name of three Israelites","kjv":"Ahio","count":6,"share":1},{"strong":"H41","lemma":"אֲבִינָדָב","xlit":"ʼĂbîynâdâb","gloss":"Abinadab, the name of four Israelites","kjv":"Abinadab","count":3,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H1446","lemma":"גְדֹר","xlit":"Gᵉdôr","gloss":"Gedor, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Gedor","count":2,"share":0.33},{"strong":"H727","lemma":"אָרוֹן","xlit":"ʼârôwn","gloss":"a box","kjv":"ark, chest, coffin","count":3,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H5798","lemma":"עֻזָּא","xlit":"ʻUzzâʼ","gloss":"Uzza or Uzzah, the name of five Israelites","kjv":"Uzza, Uzzah","count":2,"share":0.33},{"strong":"H5699","lemma":"עֲגָלָה","xlit":"ʻăgâlâh","gloss":"something revolving","kjv":"cart, chariot, wagon","count":2,"share":0.33}],"verses":["2Sam.6.3","2Sam.6.4","1Chr.8.14","1Chr.8.31","1Chr.9.37","1Chr.13.7"],"related":[{"id":"abinadab","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.231,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"kirjath-jearim","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.103,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"gedor","type":"lexical","strong":"H283","why":"both lead with אַחְיוֹ (H283)"},{"id":"abinadab","type":"lexical","strong":"H41","why":"both lead with אֲבִינָדָב (H41)"},{"id":"melchishua","type":"lexical","strong":"H41","why":"both lead with אֲבִינָדָב (H41)"}],"works":[]}
